cription\": \"Open the specified application.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"app_name\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"The name of the app to open.\"}}, \"required\": [\"app_name\"]}}\n{\"type\": \"function\", \"name\": \"press_back\", \"description\": \"Press the back button.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {}, \"required\": []}}\n{\"type\": \"function\", \"name\": \"press_enter\", \"description\": \"Press the enter key.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {}, \"required\": []}}\n{\"type\": \"function\", \"name\": \"press_home\", \"description\": \"Press the home button.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {}, \"required\": []}}\n{\"type\": \"function\", \"name\": \"take_notes\", \"description\": \"Take notes and report the result in the specified content.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"content\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"The content of the notes to take. Use \\\\', \\\\\\\" and \\\\\\\\n to ensure proper parsing in Python string format.\"}}, \"required\": [\"content\"]}}\n{\"type\": \"function\", \"name\": \"type\", \"description\": \"Type the specified content. You should manually delete any text from the input box that you want to remove.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"content\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"The text content to type. Use \\\\', \\\\\\\" and \\\\\\\\n to ensure proper parsing in Python string format. Add '\\\\\\\\n' at the end of the content to submit input.\"}}, \"required\": [\"content\"]}}\n{\"type\": \"function\", \"name\": \"wait\", \"description\": \"Wait for a certain period of time.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {}, \"required\": []}}\n\n- To call a function, use the following structure without any suffix:\n\n<think> reasoning process </think>\n<seed:tool_call><function name=\"example_function_name\"><parameter n